    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: rkdp2fr3qv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow YouTube account: ZYI Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious force found you to sign a contract because of your potential, hoping that you will perform the Swarm  hunting mission and provide the power of the contract to help you become stronger. You can increase basic attributes through the power of the contract, or you can purchase props, skills, ammunition, etc. through the contract points to improve your combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.poster.avif?t=1749914843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.webm?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.mp4?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Demo Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Matching: Create your own school through the combination of weapons, props, and abilities, and enjoy a different and refreshing experience every time you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse routes: Dynamic branches are randomly generated, and adventure/treasure/elite battle routes are freely selected. Every decision changes the battle situation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Synthesis: Core items can be synthesized and advanced, unlocking dozens of synthesis formulas, bringing huge improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Mastery: High-level mastery of special attributes, activate unique effects, let the combat power soar, and reverse the situation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Strengthening: Upgrade basic attributes to high-level, unlock hidden attribute changes, and shape your ultimate character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed and casual: A game only takes 20 to 30 minutes, and you can release pressure anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-handed Play: The character attacks automatically, and you can easily enjoy the pleasure of mowing with one hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the Swarm  Tide: Facing the besieged Swarm  army, can you break through the siege and find a way to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse roles: From the fantasy sword box that controls the flying sword to the alchemy chariot bombarded by artillery fire, choose your style and gallop on the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.poster.avif?t=1749914843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.webm?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.mp4?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More unique game content will be launched in future updates, so stay tuned!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: rkdp2fr3qv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow YouTube account: ZYI Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious force found you to sign a contract because of your potential, hoping that you will perform the Swarm  hunting mission and provide the power of the contract to help you become stronger. You can increase basic attributes through the power of the contract, or you can purchase props, skills, ammunition, etc. through the contract points to improve your combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.poster.avif?t=1749914843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.webm?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.mp4?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Demo Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Matching: Create your own school through the combination of weapons, props, and abilities, and enjoy a different and refreshing experience every time you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse routes: Dynamic branches are randomly generated, and adventure/treasure/elite battle routes are freely selected. Every decision changes the battle situation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment Synthesis: Core items can be synthesized and advanced, unlocking dozens of synthesis formulas, bringing huge improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Mastery: High-level mastery of special attributes, activate unique effects, let the combat power soar, and reverse the situation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Strengthening: Upgrade basic attributes to high-level, unlock hidden attribute changes, and shape your ultimate character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed and casual: A game only takes 20 to 30 minutes, and you can release pressure anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-handed Play: The character attacks automatically, and you can easily enjoy the pleasure of mowing with one hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the Swarm  Tide: Facing the besieged Swarm  army, can you break through the siege and find a way to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse roles: From the fantasy sword box that controls the flying sword to the alchemy chariot bombarded by artillery fire, choose your style and gallop on the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.poster.avif?t=1749914843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.webm?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/3c6122980236ba879bdea23ec02f2926.mp4?t=1749914843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More unique game content will be launched in future updates, so stay tuned!</p>",
